        "description": "# “an incredible trek through the jaws of madness” 4 / 5 UploadVR\n# “Keeps you, like, right on the edge of your seat” BMFVR\n# “BGA’s storytelling is just about unimpeachable” 7 / 10 Auganix\n# “No way dude, they're coming from the freaking walls” Ohmwrecker\n# “Whoa, okay, tentacles everywhere!” Beardo Benjo\n![{\"height\":1440,\"type\":\"image\",\"width\":2560}](https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75241696_1217972979165317_8632949708981384441_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bqIYCJ5dqGYQ7kNvgHX5zJh&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AYCrWdLC3RQknGzhglRSH-AZ--XCXmQcGPnjd9eJP5oBOQ&oe=674EFB47)\n\n**Cosmic Action Horror** focusing on intense violence, deep lore and atmospheric dread. You’re marooned alone in the Bermuda triangle of space, filled with ancient derelicts and ravenous aliens.\n\nA linear narrative campaign with twisted, disturbing stories to discover. Prepare for constant action; there's no loading screens, no inventory and unlimited ammo. You will need skill and speed to rip through the ferocious swarms and get out of this corrupted hellhole in one piece.\n\n# By Grit Alone, you will survive.\n\n",
